        <type></type>
        <definition>xthermo.plotting.plot_slice</definition>
        <argsstring>(ax, sl, x=&quot;X&quot;, y=None, *regions=True, lines=True, points=True, legend=False)</argsstring>
        <name>plot_slice</name>
        <qualifiedname>xthermo.plotting.plot_slice</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>ax</type>
          <defname>ax</defname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>sl</type>
          <defname>sl</defname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>x</type>
          <defname>x</defname>
          <defval>&quot;X&quot;</defval>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>y</type>
          <defname>y</defname>
          <defval>None</defval>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>*</type>
          <declname>regions</declname>
          <defval>True</defval>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>lines</type>
          <defname>lines</defname>
          <defval>True</defval>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>points</type>
          <defname>points</defname>
          <defval>True</defval>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>legend</type>
          <defname>legend</defname>
          <defval>False</defval>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>Draw a phase-region section (the result of cH2ONaCl.Slice_constP(p) or Slice_constT(T)) on ax.

ax: an Axes or a list of Axes (e.g. the two halves of makeLogLinearAxes); everything is drawn on each.
x, y: coordinates &quot;T&quot;, &quot;P&quot;, &quot;X&quot; or &quot;H&quot; (display units, see UNITS). y defaults to &quot;T&quot; for an isobaric and &quot;P&quot; for an
isothermal section. Isobaric sections: T-X or H-X; isothermal: P-X (or H-X).
The region polygons, colours, boundary lines and invariant points are the library&apos;s. Unshaded area is single-phase
fluid. The three-phase V+L+H region of an isobaric section is a line in T-X and a triangle in H-X.
legend: add a legend to the (last) Axes. Returns {label: artist} for building a legend.
</verbatim> </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
